    "content": "Signature\n<Tabs>\n<Tab title=\"Node\">\n\n```ts\ncheckMany(binaries: string[]): Promise<DepCheckResult[]>\n```\n\n</Tab>\n<Tab title=\"Python\">\n\n```python\ncheck_many(binaries) -> list[dict]\n```\n\n</Tab>\n<Tab title=\"R\">\n\n```r\ncheck_many(binaries)\n```\n\n</Tab>\n<Tab title=\"Native (Rust)\">\n\n```rust\ncheck_many(binaries: &[&str]) -> Result<Value>\n```\n\n</Tab>\n</Tabs>"
