    "sourceKind": "documentation",
    "title": "`.deps.check` — Signature",
    "locator": "Docs / Plugins / Api / Deps / Check / Signature",
    "excerpt": "Signature <Tabs> <Tab title=\"Node\"> ```ts check(binary: string): Promise<DepCheckResult> ``` </Tab> <Tab title=\"Python\"> ```python check(binary) -> dict ``` </Tab> <Tab title=\"R\"> ```r check(binary) ``` </Tab> <Tab title=\"Native (Rust)\"> ```rust check(binary:…",
    "content": "Signature\n<Tabs>\n<Tab title=\"Node\">\n\n```ts\ncheck(binary: string): Promise<DepCheckResult>\n```\n\n</Tab>\n<Tab title=\"Python\">\n\n```python\ncheck(binary) -> dict\n```\n\n</Tab>\n<Tab title=\"R\">\n\n```r\ncheck(binary)\n```\n\n</Tab>\n<Tab title=\"Native (Rust)\">\n\n```rust\ncheck(binary: &str) -> Result<Value>\n```\n\n</Tab>\n</Tabs>"
