    "title": "BWA-MEM — How to read the result",
    "locator": "Docs / Tools / Bwa Mem / How to read the result",
    "excerpt": "How to read the result The SAM file is usually an intermediate file. For real workflows, you normally convert, sort, and index it with Samtools before downstream analysis. Check logs for indexing or reference errors. If the run is very slow, increase threads…",
    "content": "How to read the result\nThe SAM file is usually an intermediate file. For real workflows, you normally\nconvert, sort, and index it with Samtools before downstream analysis.\n\nCheck logs for indexing or reference errors. If the run is very slow, increase\nthreads when your machine has enough CPU cores."
